  },
  {
   "v": "lyova",
   "t": "молодец",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": ". It's a natural way to say 'you too'.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "fedya",
   "t": "Ну что, мы включаем режим терминатора?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Well, are we switching on Terminator mode?' Let's break down the phrase: ",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "fedya",
   "t": "включаем",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": " is the verb for switching on lights, machines, and modes alike. ",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "fedya",
   "t": "терминатора",
