  },
  {
   "v": "lyova",
   "t": "включаем",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": ". Repeating the verb is a natural way to say 'yes, we are'.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "senya",
   "t": "Тогда быстрее за работу.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Then faster to work.' Let us inspect this line: ",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "senya",
   "t": "за",
