   "t": "готовить",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": " share a root, so it sounds like 'ready to ready'. Fedya is playing with the words.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "lyova",
   "t": "Отлично, давайте быстрее.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Excellent, let's go faster.' Now let's consider the speech: ",
